    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Colleran Auctioneers are delighted to present this very well maintained two/three bedroom semi detached home opposite the gates of Galway University. Snipe Ave will appeal equally to owner-occupiers and investors alike, given its superb location.\n\nSnipe Ave is a bright, compact two bedroom semi with the option of a third bedroom on the ground floor. It is ideally positioned directly across the road from the University, just a five-minute walk to the Hospital and within easy walking distance of the city centre. The ground floor accommodation includes an entrance hall, spacious kitchen/dining room, sitting room/third bedroom and on the first floor there are two double bedrooms, along with a main bathroom. Outside there is off street parking and a walled back yard. \n\nThanks to its prime location, this property is perfectly suited to a first time buyer, an investor as no rent cap applies, or as a comfortable home for students attending university in Galway.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.9m (6'3\") x 1.8m (5'11\")\n\nSitting Room/ 3rd Bedroom - 4.8m (15'9\") x 2.2m (7'3\")\nWith open fireplace.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.8m (15'9\") x 3m (9'10\")\nFitted kitchen with a generous range of built in and overhead cupboard space.\n\nFirst Floor\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.8m (15'9\") x 2.3m (7'7\")\nWith built in wardrobe and sink unit.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m (11'6\") x 2.9m (9'6\")\nWith built in wardrobe and sink unit.\n\nBathroom - 1.9m (6'3\") x 1.9m (6'3\")\nFitted with toilet, wash hand basin and shower. Fully tiled.\n\nHeating\nGas central heating.\n\nGardens\nThis property sits on a South facing, sun filled, walled back yard with a block built shed.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 2/3 bedroom semi opposite gates of Galway University. </li><li> Presented in excellent condition and ready for immediate occupancy. </li><li> Ideal first home or investment due to location and price. </li><li> Valuable off street parking and walled back yard. </li><li> Immediate viewing recommended.</li></ul>"
      },
